ws the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A person pressed Restore this version on a resource diff of the History panel, on a desktop layout, as a member who holds history.restore and the write key of the resource kind.","The base state is the confirmation of a View restored from the version that is compared with its parent, while the dialog has already read the current revision.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the dialog is centered over a dimmed ground."],"intent":"Show the Restore this version dialog of a resource diff in the History panel as built from Adapter Widgets only: the confirmation, the impact list that asks for a second explicit confirmation, and the conflict, edit lock and refusal answers.","interactionRules":["The confirmation says which version the resource gets its content from and that it is written as a new revision, that every version stays in history and that no other resource changes; a View keeps its current Decisions.","Opening the dialog reads the resource, so the write is checked against the current revision; Restore is disabled until it is read, when the resource already matches the version, and when a write key is missing, which the dialog names.","When the restore would affect what other resources refer to, nothing is written and the dialog lists the effects by group with their count; only Restore anyway writes.","A revision that changed while the dialog was open, or an edit lock held by someone else, writes nothing and offers Reload; any other refusal names the reason and offers Close.","A resource that no longer exists is re-created with its original identity."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the four core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"a4c1d702-6e